			<text><![CDATA[Put shape file in associated district folder on the
SharePoint. Opening spatial includes the entire gross
opening area. BC Albers Projection Name convention:
ProjectID_Opening or ProjectID_ActivityDescription]]></text>
			<box>
				<topPen lineWidth="1.0" lineColor="#000000" />
				<leftPen lineWidth="1.0" lineColor="#000000" />
